WEBVTT

00:10:28.999 --> 00:10:30.125
Solo estar.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.007
Eso es todo, sin tener que meditar.

00:10:37.383 --> 00:10:42.513
El sentido de la presencia,
de estar, sin perderse.

00:10:43.806 --> 00:10:44.973
Ser libre.

00:10:45.474 --> 00:10:46.475
Estar presente.

00:10:46.558 --> 00:10:47.559
Muchas gracias.

00:10:48.143 --> 00:10:52.356
(Aplausos)